# W4h, a (k5): takes the gate at @100 with nothing running (its PLAN dropped: the press goes out after 1 s); its new
# instance (Public, its remembered default) is still starting when b arrives. It plays alone.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=1800 fail present>=2
log a alone
idle until frames>=60
